fixture charged_on_cling_frame_goes_away
doc Movement review 6, M3; docs/adr/0010 Wall, "A press on the tick the player reaches a wall is a press on the wall". The Charged strike let go on the tick the fall clings to the shaft wall (24) goes away from the wall, as a side strike, dash or toss on that tick does (strike_on_cling_frame_goes_away). Before the fix it went into the wall: its box was live on the wall side on 27 to 32 while Ash faced away.
room test/shaft
spawn 690 100
frames 50
input
  0..9 attack
  10..23 R attack
  24..49 R
end
expect
  at 0 action=side1
  at 24 event.wall_cling=1 event.charge_release=1 action=charged
  at 24 action_dir=-1 facing=-1
  at 27 strike=1 action_dir=-1
end
